WEBVTT

01:14.480 --> 01:19.140
[Meet Yourself]

01:19.820 --> 01:24.140
[Episode 38]

01:37.815 --> 01:38.815
Dad.

01:39.295 --> 01:41.094
I'm afraid.

01:41.095 --> 01:42.255
Why?

01:42.655 --> 01:44.454
Uncle Yao is frozen.

01:44.455 --> 01:46.575
Is he dead?

01:51.895 --> 01:54.255
Go to clap him and
check if he is alive.

01:56.175 --> 01:57.615
No, I'm afraid.

02:00.015 --> 02:01.174
He is dead.

02:01.175 --> 02:03.095
Look, flies are around Uncle Yao.

02:13.255 --> 02:14.255
Stop.

02:15.055 --> 02:17.255
Look, Uncle Yao is wakened by your noise.

02:17.735 --> 02:18.455
Yang Guanjun.

02:18.456 --> 02:20.134
What's your problem?

02:20.135 --> 02:21.975
Why did you scare the kid?

02:23.255 --> 02:23.975
Guobao, come here.

02:23.976 --> 02:25.134
Come on.

02:25.135 --> 02:26.575
Ignore what he said.

02:27.095 --> 02:27.654
Come on.

02:27.655 --> 02:29.335
Don't cry.

02:30.495 --> 02:31.774
Don't take his words seriously.

02:31.775 --> 02:32.175
Ok?

02:32.176 --> 02:33.254
Come on, good boy.

02:33.255 --> 02:34.734
See, Uncle Yao is still breathing.

02:34.735 --> 02:35.735
Look.

02:36.255 --> 02:37.734
I have breath.

02:37.735 --> 02:39.215
And I can fart, right?

02:41.055 --> 02:41.934
Do you like it?

02:41.935 --> 02:43.775
Yeah, when my dad did this at home,

02:44.895 --> 02:47.015
My mom always said he is smelly.

02:50.535 --> 02:51.975
Do you like Uncle Yao?

02:52.615 --> 02:54.294
Then call me Dad.

02:54.295 --> 02:55.295
Dad.

02:56.575 --> 02:57.614
Say it again.

02:57.615 --> 02:59.095
Dad. Dad.

02:59.375 --> 03:00.455
Give dad a kiss.

03:01.495 --> 03:02.775
Good boy.

03:05.055 --> 03:06.295
Mom.

03:08.935 --> 03:09.935
Ms. Yang.

03:10.735 --> 03:12.095
I'm just kidding.

03:20.415 --> 03:21.774
Is it enough for you?

03:21.775 --> 03:23.174
I have another egg.

03:23.175 --> 03:24.455
Do you need that?

03:24.815 --> 03:25.815
No.

03:26.415 --> 03:27.415
You deserved it.

03:31.255 --> 03:32.615
What's wrong?

03:32.855 --> 03:34.455
He hit on my wife's ring.

03:34.895 --> 03:36.215
It swells up.

03:41.215 --> 03:42.654
Why do you come so late?

03:42.655 --> 03:44.855
It's a two-shareholders' meeting,
why did it take so long?

03:46.055 --> 03:47.055
Does it hurt?

03:47.615 --> 03:48.615
I'm fine.

03:49.935 --> 03:51.335
We just had a small talk.

03:57.495 --> 03:59.094
What happened this afternoon?

03:59.095 --> 04:00.895
You looked upset.

04:06.095 --> 04:07.815
You can tell me all.

04:09.375 --> 04:11.094
Just business stuff.

04:11.095 --> 04:12.414
It's a mess.

04:12.415 --> 04:13.215
No big problem.

04:13.216 --> 04:14.375
Always small troubles.

04:15.295 --> 04:17.214
I was thinking that there
are some big troubles

04:17.215 --> 04:18.894
that you can't solve.

04:18.895 --> 04:20.175
I get used to that.

04:20.535 --> 04:22.894
When he meets some troubles,
he is like

04:22.895 --> 04:24.295
he has been constipated.

04:25.295 --> 04:25.895
Come on.

04:25.896 --> 04:26.854
I haven't finished my dinner.

04:26.855 --> 04:27.814
It's disgusting.

04:27.815 --> 04:29.135
Whatever.

04:29.975 --> 04:31.255
Look at Hongdou.

04:31.815 --> 04:33.295
Now I should call President Xu.

04:33.655 --> 04:34.734
It's tiring to do the decoration.

04:34.735 --> 04:36.254
But she is so energetic.

04:36.255 --> 04:37.535
But look at you.

04:38.775 --> 04:39.975
Is it the same?

04:40.215 --> 04:42.254
President Xu's guesthouse isn't open yet.

04:42.255 --> 04:44.934
But when you renewed and
opened a tie-dye workshop,

04:44.935 --> 04:47.015
you got drunk at my home and cried out,

04:47.255 --> 04:48.574
you were complaining about your dad a lot.

04:48.575 --> 04:49.175
Come on, stop.

04:49.175 --> 04:49.935
It's enough.

04:49.936 --> 04:51.014
Don't say it all.

04:51.015 --> 04:52.215
Really?

04:52.695 --> 04:53.654
Tell me more.

04:53.655 --> 04:55.894
You don't know,
his tears were like a waterfall.

04:55.895 --> 04:57.134
Okay, come on.

04:57.135 --> 04:57.695
Ms. Xu.

04:57.696 --> 04:59.014
I lose. Alright?

04:59.015 --> 05:00.054
I'll drink up this can of beer.

05:00.055 --> 05:01.054
No, no.

05:01.055 --> 05:03.174
The rest, I will bottom up.

05:03.175 --> 05:04.414
No.

05:04.415 --> 05:05.895
I don't drink a lot.

05:06.215 --> 05:07.295
Leave me some.

05:08.175 --> 05:09.175
Leave me some.

05:09.695 --> 05:10.975
Please.

05:12.855 --> 05:13.694
Give me.

05:13.695 --> 05:15.015
Or I can drink yours.

05:29.455 --> 05:30.455
Mom.

05:31.775 --> 05:32.895
Mom.

05:33.855 --> 05:34.495
You're back.

05:34.496 --> 05:35.935
Take a shower, and have a rest.

05:36.655 --> 05:37.695
Where's Luo Quan?

05:39.095 --> 05:40.254
Luo Quan?

05:40.255 --> 05:41.255
Is he back home?

05:41.455 --> 05:42.814
Yeah, I asked him to come.

05:42.815 --> 05:44.495
My dad is here?

05:45.615 --> 05:45.935
Wait.

05:45.936 --> 05:47.335
I'll give him a call.

05:54.415 --> 05:56.494
Sorry, the number you have dialed is busy now.

05:56.495 --> 05:58.695
Please try again later.

05:59.695 --> 06:00.975
He doesn't answer?

06:02.255 --> 06:03.494
I guess he is busy now.

06:03.495 --> 06:04.495
Never mind.

06:04.815 --> 06:05.935
I'll go upstairs first.

06:21.775 --> 06:25.814
Sorry,
the number you have dialed is busy now.

06:25.815 --> 06:27.975
Please try again later.

06:39.375 --> 06:40.375
Mom.

06:40.735 --> 06:42.255
Do you know where Luo Quan is?

06:42.855 --> 06:44.815
He went to meet you, didn't he?

06:45.015 --> 06:46.854
Yeah,
this afternoon he came to me.

06:46.855 --> 06:48.654
But I was working and busy.

06:48.655 --> 06:50.614
I asked him to wait for me at home.

06:50.615 --> 06:52.094
But he didn't come.

06:52.095 --> 06:54.495
Now I called him,
no one answered.

06:54.895 --> 06:58.335
Did he talk with you about Hulu?

06:58.775 --> 06:59.694
Yeah.

06:59.695 --> 07:00.695
Mom.

07:01.455 --> 07:03.014
Thanks for your understanding.

07:03.015 --> 07:04.094
Don't worry.

07:04.095 --> 07:06.854
When Hulu is on her vacation,
I'll let her go to Kunming,

07:06.855 --> 07:07.975
to visit you.

07:09.495 --> 07:13.055
He didn't tell you how he talked with his dad,
right?

07:14.015 --> 07:18.094
He told his dad,
Xiaochun wouldn't remarry me.

07:18.095 --> 07:21.254
Later if you set blind dates for me,
I won't say no.

07:21.255 --> 07:24.094
But if I want to have a new girlfriend,
Hulu lives with me,

07:24.095 --> 07:26.254
then no one wants to marry me.

07:26.255 --> 07:28.135
It's better to live with Xiaochun.

07:29.175 --> 07:32.494
His dad was so angry,
and beat him up so heavily.

07:32.495 --> 07:37.215
He left with a lot of wounds,
suffering bruises.

07:38.015 --> 07:39.375
Xiaochun.

07:40.175 --> 07:42.294
Please take him to the hospital.

07:42.295 --> 07:44.174
Why did he say that?

07:44.175 --> 07:45.174
Xiaochun.

07:45.175 --> 07:46.614
You know him.

07:46.615 --> 07:48.334
He isn't a bad guy.

07:48.335 --> 07:50.054
If he does think like that,

07:50.055 --> 07:51.534
you have been divorced for three years,

07:51.535 --> 07:54.494
he could have started a new life long ago.

07:54.495 --> 07:57.014
He did that for your requirements.

07:57.015 --> 07:59.714
So he took the blame himself.

07:59.715 --> 08:02.574
Later, please treat him well.

08:02.575 --> 08:04.574
And talk to him gently.

08:04.575 --> 08:06.454
Don't be angry with him.

08:06.455 --> 08:09.574
Even if he is not your husband anymore,

08:09.575 --> 08:11.494
he's still Hulu's father.

08:11.495 --> 08:12.575
Right?

08:14.935 --> 08:15.935
Luo Quan.

08:16.135 --> 08:16.575
Mom.

08:16.576 --> 08:18.934
Why do you come back without telling us?

08:18.935 --> 08:20.094
Come on.

08:20.095 --> 08:21.294
Talk to Xiaochun.

08:21.295 --> 08:22.975
She's worried.

08:24.495 --> 08:25.495
Xiaochun.

08:25.775 --> 08:27.375
I was parking in the garage.

08:27.575 --> 08:29.095
There's no signal in the elevator.

08:30.015 --> 08:30.894
Okay.

08:30.895 --> 08:31.935
It's fine.

08:32.215 --> 08:33.215
Bye, take care.

08:59.135 --> 09:00.735
Who is so boring?

09:01.055 --> 09:03.055
Maybe some spoiled brats.

09:05.335 --> 09:06.454
Look at this painting.

09:06.455 --> 09:07.695
This position.

09:07.975 --> 09:09.735
It should be about the same height as me.

09:10.255 --> 09:11.535
And ugly painting style.

09:12.295 --> 09:15.735
Only one shop sells
spray paint in our town, right?

09:15.935 --> 09:17.575
What if it's bought online?

09:21.535 --> 09:22.054
Forget it.

09:22.055 --> 09:23.214
Just let it go.

09:23.215 --> 09:24.375
I guess it's a joke.

09:24.815 --> 09:27.494
Later,
I'll install two cameras on the gate.

09:27.495 --> 09:28.775
It's time to install cameras.

09:29.535 --> 09:30.534
I've bought cameras online.

09:30.535 --> 09:31.734
I haven't received them yet.

09:31.735 --> 09:32.375
Yeah, you're right.

09:32.376 --> 09:33.775
More and more stuff later.

09:35.215 --> 09:36.575
Don't worry, it's okay.

09:36.775 --> 09:39.415
First of all,
I'll change your gates.

09:40.615 --> 09:42.295
I feel something wrong.

09:42.935 --> 09:44.095
What?

09:45.215 --> 09:46.094
I'm not sure.

09:46.095 --> 09:46.575
Look.

09:46.576 --> 09:48.775
I always feel when I meet
the villagers sometimes,

09:49.175 --> 09:50.735
they will discuss me.

09:51.855 --> 09:53.574
Isn't it normal?

09:53.575 --> 09:54.734
When a salesman shows up,

09:54.735 --> 09:56.334
he will be the only topic from the east side

09:56.335 --> 09:58.055
to the west side of the village.

09:58.295 --> 09:59.855
The villagers will gather and talk,

10:00.735 --> 10:03.975
that girl, is Yao's girlfriend.

10:04.495 --> 10:05.934
She has really good taste.

10:05.935 --> 10:07.414
So she knows Yao is a good man.

10:07.415 --> 10:09.735
You... You're so cheeky.

10:09.975 --> 10:11.615
Maybe they say like,

10:12.415 --> 10:16.454
look at this pretty lady,
I don't know why she likes Yao.

10:16.455 --> 10:17.655
Why?

10:18.775 --> 10:19.935
Maybe I'm handsome.

10:20.815 --> 10:22.095
Granny said

10:22.495 --> 10:23.975
you'll be ugly when you're old.

10:24.215 --> 10:25.775
She told lies.

10:28.135 --> 10:29.014
See you later.

10:29.015 --> 10:30.095
Here you are.

10:32.455 --> 10:33.455
Wait.

10:35.095 --> 10:36.095
Give me a hug.

10:53.935 --> 10:55.054
I'll prepare a good dinner for you.

10:55.055 --> 10:55.775
It's okay, I'll do it.

10:55.775 --> 10:56.775
What do you want?

10:57.215 --> 10:58.054
No, thanks.

10:58.055 --> 11:01.775
Your hometown recipe
should be left to your hometown.

11:04.215 --> 11:05.414
No, a chokehold is not allowed.

11:05.415 --> 11:06.135
What?

11:06.136 --> 11:07.415
My mom taught me.

11:07.775 --> 11:09.054
Okay, fine.

11:09.055 --> 11:10.175
I have to go.

11:13.535 --> 11:14.015
Be careful.

11:14.015 --> 11:15.095
Goodbye.

11:16.175 --> 11:17.175
Bye.

11:44.055 --> 11:45.055
Xiaochun.

11:45.175 --> 11:46.655
Are you in the shop or in the warehouse?

11:49.215 --> 11:51.494
Could you please go spray painting shop in town

11:51.495 --> 11:54.095
and ask if anyone in our
village bought white paint?

11:55.015 --> 11:55.774
Okay.

11:55.775 --> 11:57.095
Tell me if you know.

11:58.255 --> 11:59.255
Bye.

12:09.015 --> 12:10.135
Hongdou.

12:10.455 --> 12:11.535
Hongdou.

12:12.735 --> 12:13.934
Aunt Gui.

12:13.935 --> 12:16.295
I'd like to see how your decoration is now.

12:17.495 --> 12:19.534
It's the same as before.

12:19.535 --> 12:21.294
The yard is the last part to decorate.

12:21.295 --> 12:22.775
Now you can't tell the difference.

12:22.975 --> 12:24.014
Have some tea.

12:24.015 --> 12:25.455
Yeah, have some tea.

12:31.575 --> 12:32.615
Aunt Gui.

12:33.135 --> 12:35.174
Are you bringing
lunch to Uncle Zeqing?

12:35.175 --> 12:36.295
No.

12:39.255 --> 12:41.334
I've done my own work.

12:41.335 --> 12:42.774
And it's so boring.

12:42.775 --> 12:45.375
So I walk around,
and relax myself.

12:47.375 --> 12:51.134
The warehouse, as long as I'm there,
Yue, you know her,

12:51.135 --> 12:52.855
will stare at me like this.

12:54.015 --> 12:54.854
She doesn't say anything.

12:54.855 --> 12:56.615
But I know what she is going to say.

12:56.935 --> 12:58.375
Why are you here again?

12:59.335 --> 13:01.415
They want me to leave soon.

13:02.215 --> 13:04.734
Auntie Feng,
and Aunt Baoping are working.

13:04.735 --> 13:06.014
You always chat with them.

13:06.015 --> 13:07.974
You must bother them to work.

13:07.975 --> 13:09.454
So I'm here to talk with you.

13:09.455 --> 13:10.655
Welcome.

13:17.175 --> 13:18.175
Hongdou.

13:20.855 --> 13:23.695
Recently rumor spreads in the village.

13:24.295 --> 13:25.575
Have you heard about it?

13:26.575 --> 13:29.095
If you don't tell me,
how can I know?

13:30.575 --> 13:31.975
They're saying

13:32.175 --> 13:35.295
many people in the village
want to earn a lot of money.

13:35.615 --> 13:39.014
And they would like to
run their own guesthouse.

13:39.015 --> 13:41.294
Some villagers want to open a clothing store.

13:41.295 --> 13:43.535
Some would like to buy a new car.

13:44.135 --> 13:46.614
They went to the Village Committee and asked.

13:46.615 --> 13:49.775
And Village Committee asked for
Yao's suggestions.

13:50.295 --> 13:51.174
Well.

13:51.175 --> 13:52.375
The gossip spreads then.

13:52.735 --> 13:57.248
They said it was Yao who
suggested a lot to stop them.

13:57.495 --> 13:59.894
They said Yao was afraid
others competed with him,

13:59.895 --> 14:01.734
so he'd lose his customers.

14:01.735 --> 14:05.094
Also said Yao would like
to earn money secretly,

14:05.095 --> 14:06.294
and monopolize the market.

14:06.295 --> 14:08.255
Earn all of the money.

14:08.575 --> 14:11.894
They said that Yao knew this
bookstore was going to open,

14:11.895 --> 14:13.215
and let his girlfriend,

14:14.055 --> 14:16.895
you, rent this house in advance.

14:17.095 --> 14:18.695
You can earn money together.

14:19.015 --> 14:21.014
But Yao has never stopped them
from making money.

14:21.015 --> 14:22.535
Who said that?

14:23.095 --> 14:24.054
I don't know.

14:24.055 --> 14:25.574
Several days ago, it started spreading.

14:25.575 --> 14:27.375
I don't know who started it.

14:28.095 --> 14:29.254
Aunt Gui.

14:29.255 --> 14:30.614
I got this guesthouse,

14:30.615 --> 14:32.294
because the previous owner couldn't do it

14:32.295 --> 14:34.134
and transferred this house.

14:34.135 --> 14:35.815
No one wanted to take over.

14:36.335 --> 14:38.014
I knew that.

14:38.015 --> 14:41.214
At that time,
Huang and Yao were so worried.

14:41.215 --> 14:42.695
I knew that.

14:44.975 --> 14:45.975
Hongdou.

14:46.175 --> 14:48.055
Don't take it seriously.

14:48.935 --> 14:49.935
These people,

14:50.375 --> 14:52.494
they were laughing at you before,

14:52.495 --> 14:54.574
but they are jealous of you.

14:54.575 --> 14:57.095
Even Yao has known this rumor.

14:57.415 --> 15:01.535
If it was not Yao,
others would have fought against them.

15:02.255 --> 15:03.854
But Yao just smiled.

15:03.855 --> 15:05.775
He just ignored them.

15:06.615 --> 15:07.814
The villagers are too rude.

15:07.815 --> 15:09.495
Talked the gossip in front of him.

15:10.375 --> 15:13.455
That's why I always say
Yao can be successful.

15:13.775 --> 15:14.974
He is kind and broad-minded.

15:14.975 --> 15:15.975
Right?

15:22.095 --> 15:23.334
Granny.

15:23.335 --> 15:24.254
I have a bath towel.

15:24.255 --> 15:25.295
You don't need to...

15:26.455 --> 15:27.975
Xu Hongdou. Well.

15:31.735 --> 15:32.934
You are in shorts.

15:32.935 --> 15:34.215
I can see nothing.

15:34.615 --> 15:35.975
Why do you run so fast?

15:37.375 --> 15:39.214
Why do you come here? It's late.

15:39.215 --> 15:40.374
I come to see you.

15:40.375 --> 15:42.894
You told me that you'd
go to the supplier tomorrow

15:42.895 --> 15:44.175
and come back the day after tomorrow.

15:46.648 --> 15:48.368
You can't live without me?

15:50.335 --> 15:51.335
Or I leave.

15:53.015 --> 15:54.015
Hongdou.

15:54.295 --> 15:55.455
Come back.

16:04.295 --> 16:08.095
Have you heard about
those weird rumors recently?

16:08.735 --> 16:09.775
What kind of gossip?

16:11.255 --> 16:13.654
Villagers said you stopped others
to run their business.

16:13.655 --> 16:15.374
They said you wanted to earn all money.

16:15.375 --> 16:16.894
And you knew the bookstore was going to open,

16:16.895 --> 16:18.975
so you let your girlfriend run a guesthouse.

16:20.535 --> 16:21.935
Who told you?

16:22.335 --> 16:24.495
Someone talked the gossip in front of you?

16:24.975 --> 16:26.934
Not in front of me.

16:26.935 --> 16:29.135
But I have a know-all friend.

16:29.415 --> 16:30.655
Know-all friend?

16:31.215 --> 16:32.295
Aunt Gui?

16:33.535 --> 16:34.655
Right.

16:35.175 --> 16:36.535
Have you already known it?

16:39.655 --> 16:41.655
Ignore what they said.

16:42.215 --> 16:45.174
I didn't tell you,
because I don't want you to be upset

16:45.175 --> 16:46.214
when you hear that.

16:46.215 --> 16:48.575
They've painted on my gate.

16:48.935 --> 16:50.615
Aren't you going to tell me?

16:51.215 --> 16:52.574
Don't worry.

16:52.575 --> 16:53.655
I'll handle it.

16:54.535 --> 16:56.414
Then you can't only tell me the good part.

16:56.415 --> 16:58.374
And hide the bad part.

16:58.375 --> 17:01.215
You aren't a living filter of gossip.

17:02.495 --> 17:04.854
I want to protect you.

17:04.855 --> 17:06.134
You are not my dad.

17:06.135 --> 17:08.935
You don't need to provide an
unharmful environment for me.

17:10.375 --> 17:12.495
I don't want you to be upset.

17:13.655 --> 17:14.654
If you're like a bird of joy.

17:14.655 --> 17:16.175
I'll be upset.

17:16.535 --> 17:19.855
I'm not an egg,
which needs to be protected by you.

17:20.095 --> 17:21.735
I am not that weak.

17:22.295 --> 17:23.975
We need to fight together.

17:24.175 --> 17:24.495
Right?

17:24.496 --> 17:25.734
Share the information.

17:25.735 --> 17:27.335
Share the pressure.

17:27.815 --> 17:28.815
Got it?

17:29.815 --> 17:30.734
Yeah.

17:30.735 --> 17:32.055
You do understand?

17:33.255 --> 17:34.774
Have you told me everything?

17:34.775 --> 17:36.054
Yeah.

17:36.055 --> 17:36.855
That's all.

17:36.856 --> 17:38.294
Really.

17:38.295 --> 17:40.094
And this time I wasn't on purpose.

17:40.095 --> 17:41.454
Okay.

17:41.455 --> 17:43.014
Let me flick your forehead.

17:43.015 --> 17:44.295
I'll forgive you.

17:44.655 --> 17:45.135
Come on.

17:45.136 --> 17:46.375
You won't flick heavily.

17:58.575 --> 17:59.814
Thank you.

17:59.815 --> 18:01.175
Kind and pretty lady.

18:01.455 --> 18:02.454
Right.

18:02.455 --> 18:04.174
I do have that advantage.

18:04.175 --> 18:05.295
What should I do?

18:07.615 --> 18:08.015
It's late.

18:08.016 --> 18:09.375
I have to go now.

18:10.455 --> 18:11.495
Don't leave.

18:11.735 --> 18:12.654
Join me.

18:12.655 --> 18:13.695
What?

18:14.975 --> 18:16.055
Have a good rest.

18:16.255 --> 18:17.335
In good spirits.

18:18.215 --> 18:19.215
Good night.

18:19.495 --> 18:19.895
Well. No.

18:19.896 --> 18:21.014
Don't leave.

18:21.015 --> 18:21.575
Wait for me.

18:21.576 --> 18:22.454
I wear my cloth.

18:22.455 --> 18:23.775
Hongdou. Hongdou.

18:28.335 --> 18:29.414
Manjun.

18:29.415 --> 18:30.575
Hi, Xiaochun.

18:31.415 --> 18:34.374
Aunt Gui said you need
some cleaning products.

18:34.375 --> 18:35.655
I bring some to you.

18:42.295 --> 18:45.375
Are you going to the farm again?

18:47.415 --> 18:49.214
You've planted so many trees.

18:49.215 --> 18:51.214
But you don't stay for a long time.

18:51.215 --> 18:53.055
When you leave, how about the trees?

18:53.575 --> 18:55.414
I rent that farm for five years.

18:55.415 --> 18:57.895
The landlord can take
care of trees after I leave.

18:58.495 --> 18:59.575
That's good.

19:05.135 --> 19:06.175
Manjun.

19:06.655 --> 19:07.015
Look.

19:07.016 --> 19:09.175
You've been here for a long time.

19:10.175 --> 19:11.855
I didn't ask you before.

19:13.615 --> 19:17.135
Why did you and your husband divorce?

19:18.135 --> 19:19.575
Did he cheat on you?

19:20.375 --> 19:21.375
No.

19:22.175 --> 19:23.535
Then you cheated on him?

19:25.255 --> 19:27.975
You and your husband divorced,
because of cheating?

19:28.735 --> 19:29.735
Well no.

19:32.095 --> 19:33.335
We two were not a good match,

19:33.895 --> 19:35.415
didn't get along well.

19:35.975 --> 19:39.495
And after we graduated,
we got married.

19:39.735 --> 19:42.415
When we were not so mature,

19:42.735 --> 19:44.295
we had a baby.

19:44.775 --> 19:46.575
We were so busy

19:47.455 --> 19:49.855
after we had Hulu.

19:50.615 --> 19:53.814
At that time, he had a job.

19:53.815 --> 19:56.415
Well, about 3000 yuan per month.

19:56.775 --> 19:59.254
Later he was persuaded by his mate,

19:59.255 --> 20:01.415
selling water purifiers could earn a lot.

20:02.175 --> 20:04.095
His mate may earn a lot.

20:04.455 --> 20:08.415
So he didn't talk with me,
and resigned directly,

20:09.375 --> 20:11.335
and went to sell water purifiers.

20:12.255 --> 20:13.735
But to be honest,

20:15.615 --> 20:17.774
he was not a salesman at all.

20:17.775 --> 20:19.935
I don't know what
he is thinking.

20:20.655 --> 20:21.895
At first,

20:22.255 --> 20:27.254
our relatives and friends would patronize,
and buy from him.

20:27.255 --> 20:29.895
So he'd make money at that time.

20:30.495 --> 20:31.575
However,

20:31.855 --> 20:33.414
each of my friends already had one,

20:33.415 --> 20:34.895
they wouldn't buy anymore.

20:35.215 --> 20:38.215
He had to go out and sell to others.

20:39.015 --> 20:40.255
But at that time,

20:40.495 --> 20:42.655
I just gave birth to Hulu.

20:43.975 --> 20:47.054
I didn't have enough sleep each day.

20:47.055 --> 20:49.174
Moreover,
I took care of Hulu myself.

20:49.175 --> 20:50.175
I felt

20:50.735 --> 20:51.774
my mood wasn't good.

20:51.775 --> 20:53.294
I was under great pressure.

20:53.295 --> 20:57.975
And he, in order to sell more purifiers,
always got drunk.

20:58.215 --> 21:00.494
Every time he went back,
he was drunk.

21:00.495 --> 21:01.855
I had to take care of him.

21:02.735 --> 21:04.895
Do you still complain about him in your mind?

21:07.535 --> 21:08.454
How about you?

21:08.455 --> 21:09.695
Don't you?

21:12.295 --> 21:16.415
My ex-husband and I were
in a traditional couple style.

21:16.935 --> 21:20.928
He earns money,
and I take care of the whole family.

21:21.495 --> 21:24.974
Actually for many years,
we even didn't have a quarrel.

21:24.975 --> 21:26.214
He respects me.

21:26.215 --> 21:27.535
And I care about him.

21:29.895 --> 21:32.654
When he started to run his own business,
it was really hard.

21:32.655 --> 21:34.095
He worked day and night.

21:34.735 --> 21:36.095
We married for 20 years.

21:36.855 --> 21:38.935
He did what he promised me.

21:39.575 --> 21:41.295
We had a happy life.

21:42.055 --> 21:43.214
It's good.

21:43.215 --> 21:44.655
Why did you divorce?

21:46.135 --> 21:48.495
When my girl was a freshman in high school,

21:48.815 --> 21:51.495
he was transferred to a
branch office to be the manager.

21:52.015 --> 21:54.734
However,
that new office was so far away from our home.

21:54.735 --> 21:57.414
So we bought an apartment around the new office,

21:57.415 --> 21:58.695
he lived there on workdays,

21:59.135 --> 22:00.735
and went back every weekend.

22:01.775 --> 22:04.535
At that apartment,
there was a camera.

22:04.895 --> 22:07.415
I could see what he was doing on my phone.

22:07.735 --> 22:08.975
What did he do?

22:10.375 --> 22:11.895
He did nothing.

22:12.815 --> 22:14.935
He lied on the couch every day,

22:15.215 --> 22:17.215
had chips, drank beer.

22:17.855 --> 22:22.415
And played games
on TV with controllers.

22:25.415 --> 22:27.815
Suddenly I felt

22:30.735 --> 22:35.374
we didn't join each other's life at all

22:35.375 --> 22:37.055
even though we were a couple.

22:39.175 --> 22:40.695
I was jealous of him.

22:43.415 --> 22:48.815
For many years,
I have been like an aqua Bonsai.

22:50.455 --> 22:52.615
I always envied the tree in the wild.

22:56.935 --> 22:58.775
I wanted to be planted in real soil.

22:59.815 --> 23:01.335
I hoped to grow up to be a tree.

23:11.935 --> 23:13.735
One, two, three, four.

23:19.975 --> 23:21.055
Three.

23:30.055 --> 23:30.974
Stop here.

23:30.975 --> 23:31.454
Stop.

23:31.455 --> 23:31.855
Stop now.

23:31.856 --> 23:32.894
Don't move.

23:32.895 --> 23:34.455
Stop it. Stop.

23:34.655 --> 23:35.655
Follow me.

23:38.735 --> 23:39.415
Everyone, stop now.

23:39.415 --> 23:39.855
Don't do it.

23:39.856 --> 23:40.814
Stop. I said stop.

23:40.815 --> 23:41.855
Stop, now.

23:42.735 --> 23:43.614
Who is in charge?

23:43.615 --> 23:44.774
I am.

23:44.775 --> 23:45.335
Nice to meet you.

23:45.336 --> 23:47.494
What's the problem?

23:47.495 --> 23:49.615
Are you Xie Zhiyao's girlfriend?

23:51.015 --> 23:52.415
Yes, you can call me Xu Hongdou.

23:52.735 --> 23:56.175
Can you... tell me why
you stopped them working?

23:56.415 --> 23:58.294
Rich people are evil.

23:58.295 --> 24:00.654
If you don't allow us to work,
you will never do it, either.

24:00.655 --> 24:01.294
Am I right?

24:01.295 --> 24:02.495
Yes.

24:05.375 --> 24:06.214
Sir.

24:06.215 --> 24:07.854
You came out of nowhere
and asked us to stop.

24:07.855 --> 24:09.775
I don't know what is going on.

24:10.255 --> 24:11.454
We can talk about it.

24:11.455 --> 24:14.414
If I am responsible for anything,
I'll solve it.

24:14.415 --> 24:16.134
Or we can go to the Village Committee.

24:16.135 --> 24:17.374
We won't go there.

24:17.375 --> 24:19.814
You bribed others,
so the village is helping you.

24:19.815 --> 24:21.734
What did we bribe?

24:21.735 --> 24:23.094
Can you prove it?

24:23.095 --> 24:24.934
Of course, you didn't leave any evidence.

24:24.935 --> 24:26.134
But I saw it all.

24:26.135 --> 24:28.134
Xie Zhiyao has found new investors.

24:28.135 --> 24:29.254
Do you want to play with fire?

24:29.255 --> 24:30.974
Do all-around development?

24:30.975 --> 24:31.854
We can't let them do it.

24:31.855 --> 24:32.855
No, we can't.

24:36.815 --> 24:38.495
Don't bully her.

24:40.735 --> 24:41.535
You want to make money.

24:41.536 --> 24:42.935
We have to make money, too.

24:47.175 --> 24:48.615
Hulu, what can we do?

24:49.055 --> 24:50.534
We have different missions.

24:50.535 --> 24:52.254
Huzi and I go to Xie's house.

24:52.255 --> 24:53.734
And he will ask others to help.

24:53.735 --> 24:55.534
You go to the Village Committee.

24:55.535 --> 24:56.654
Who should I look for?

24:56.655 --> 24:57.814
Xinxin.

24:57.815 --> 24:59.174
Anyone is fine.

24:59.175 --> 25:00.134
Ask them to come to help.

25:00.135 --> 25:01.135
Got it.

25:08.455 --> 25:11.495
Granny. Granny.

25:14.775 --> 25:16.175
What happened?

25:16.535 --> 25:17.774
What is going on?

25:17.775 --> 25:19.654
Granny, is uncle at home?

25:19.655 --> 25:21.294
We have to save Sister Hongdou.

25:21.295 --> 25:22.295
What's going on?

25:22.375 --> 25:26.934
Li Zihao's uncle took so many
people to Hongdou's place,

25:26.935 --> 25:27.814
and stopped people from working.

25:27.815 --> 25:30.614
They looked so fierce,
and they wanted to beat us.

25:30.615 --> 25:31.695
Beat you?

25:32.095 --> 25:33.254
How many are they?

25:33.255 --> 25:36.054
So many people,
with hoes and spades.

25:36.055 --> 25:37.855
We have to find my uncle.

25:41.055 --> 25:42.414
I need this for a moment.

25:42.415 --> 25:44.175
Well, I will help her.

25:45.735 --> 25:47.654
If we can't work,
you can't do it either.

25:47.655 --> 25:49.375
You have your plan...

25:49.655 --> 25:52.374
I don't know who said it to you.

25:52.375 --> 25:55.734
But you can't solve the
problem if you keep staying here.

25:55.735 --> 25:58.534
If you don't believe me,
go to the Village Committee,

25:58.535 --> 25:59.414
and find the Secretary.

25:59.415 --> 26:01.135
Or have a talk with the village Director.

26:01.575 --> 26:04.935
Xie Zhiyao,
he doesn't have the power to hide the truth,

26:05.175 --> 26:06.814
and stop you from making money.

26:06.815 --> 26:09.134
Don't pretend to be
innocent and lie to us.

26:09.135 --> 26:12.374
We've heard that the boss
only invested in your business.

26:12.375 --> 26:14.294
Offer us opportunities to work?

26:14.295 --> 26:15.454
Bullshit.

26:15.455 --> 26:17.254
He wants to be the boss
and makes us work for him,

26:17.255 --> 26:18.254
so he can make a lot of money.

26:18.255 --> 26:19.414
He wants to be the boss above us.

26:19.415 --> 26:21.054
Yes, only he can make money.

26:21.055 --> 26:22.735
Why can he do it?

26:23.255 --> 26:25.094
Well, fine.

26:25.095 --> 26:26.654
We stop working today. Is it okay?

26:26.655 --> 26:27.854
Let's go to the Committee.

26:27.855 --> 26:29.375
There's no one in the office.

26:29.815 --> 26:30.815
No one?

26:32.295 --> 26:33.695
Xie Zhiyao is not here, either.

26:33.895 --> 26:35.214
What do you want, actually?

26:35.215 --> 26:36.494
Tell me.

26:36.495 --> 26:37.494
What do we want?

26:37.495 --> 26:39.175
We want an explanation.

26:39.535 --> 26:41.335
We are not idiots.

26:41.575 --> 26:41.935
Do you see?

26:41.936 --> 26:42.934
The camera is on.

26:42.935 --> 26:45.135
Whatever you say
now is the evidence.

26:45.655 --> 26:48.175
What I do is legal and reasonable,

26:48.495 --> 26:50.935
so if you can't accept it,
call the police,

26:51.335 --> 26:53.454
bring it to the court,
ask people to investigate.

26:53.455 --> 26:54.534
You have many ways to do it.

26:54.535 --> 26:57.334
But,
if you disturb our work here like now,

26:57.335 --> 26:58.814
you can be called rioters.

26:58.815 --> 27:00.094
Rioters?

27:00.095 --> 27:00.735
Shameless.

27:00.736 --> 27:01.774
You put the blame on the victims.

27:01.775 --> 27:03.574
Yes, we are rioters. What can you do?

27:03.575 --> 27:04.215
Break it down.

27:04.215 --> 27:05.215
Do it.

27:05.495 --> 27:07.295
Wait a second. Calm down.

27:08.295 --> 27:10.055
Calm down. Wait. Don't do it.

27:10.655 --> 27:12.055
Who is here?

27:12.495 --> 27:13.414
What are you doing?

27:13.415 --> 27:14.494
What are you doing?

27:14.495 --> 27:15.534
What are you doing?

27:15.535 --> 27:17.414
Who is messing around? Who?

27:17.415 --> 27:19.255
Who is doing this?

27:20.055 --> 27:23.374
Now Yao is not at home,
so you came to bully Hongdou?

27:23.375 --> 27:25.775
Do you think I am dead?

27:26.775 --> 27:27.711
Who?

27:27.735 --> 27:28.975
Who is leading this?

27:29.655 --> 27:31.575
Who organized it?

27:36.095 --> 27:37.095
Who?

27:37.175 --> 27:38.175
Say it.

27:38.575 --> 27:39.575
I did.

27:40.575 --> 27:41.575
Granny.

27:41.735 --> 27:42.974
We have no choice.

27:42.975 --> 27:45.094
Your grandson made us lose money.

27:45.095 --> 27:46.934
Nonsense.

27:46.935 --> 27:47.894
It's nonsense.

27:47.895 --> 27:48.415
Did you lose it?

27:48.416 --> 27:49.294
Please stay calm.

27:49.295 --> 27:50.254
You don't have money now?

27:50.255 --> 27:52.495
Do you think you are so old that we can't beat you?

27:52.855 --> 27:53.415
How dare you?

27:53.415 --> 27:54.015
I will beat you.

27:54.016 --> 27:55.894
Do it. Come on.

27:55.895 --> 27:57.934
I will kick you back. I will do it.

27:57.935 --> 27:59.494
Come back.

27:59.495 --> 28:01.014
How dare you stay here?

28:01.015 --> 28:01.695
Can you stay here?

28:01.696 --> 28:03.695
I'll leave. I'm leaving.

28:08.615 --> 28:09.734
Are you alright?

28:09.735 --> 28:10.735
I'm good.

28:11.415 --> 28:13.895
How dare they come to me for troubles?

28:17.895 --> 28:18.895
How is it?

28:19.655 --> 28:20.975
Don't get angry.

28:21.255 --> 28:22.614
You've kicked them away.

28:22.615 --> 28:24.295
Even your hand got hurt.

28:24.815 --> 28:26.655
It's because Yao's not here with us,

28:27.215 --> 28:31.055
so they came to make trouble,
to bully you.

28:32.015 --> 28:33.855
You've done me justice.

28:34.735 --> 28:35.935
This isn't over.

28:36.175 --> 28:39.414
I'll go to the Committee tomorrow,
and consult with them.

28:39.415 --> 28:41.295
Villains can't do whatever they want.

28:41.575 --> 28:42.494
They can't.

28:42.495 --> 28:45.254
They should get punished,
and make an apology.

28:45.255 --> 28:46.655
That's right.

28:47.975 --> 28:48.734
Come here.

28:48.735 --> 28:49.774
Apply it.

28:49.775 --> 28:50.775
Hongdou.

28:51.015 --> 28:52.015
Granny.

28:52.455 --> 28:53.414
Are you alright?

28:53.415 --> 28:54.454
We're good.

28:54.455 --> 28:55.455
Don't worry.

28:55.935 --> 28:57.335
Have you called Yao?

28:57.535 --> 28:58.294
No.

28:58.295 --> 29:00.614
He left with Daxia
to check the products,

29:00.615 --> 29:03.214
so I don't want them
to come back in a rush.

29:03.215 --> 29:04.455
I'll tell him tomorrow.

29:05.295 --> 29:06.295
Granny.

29:07.815 --> 29:08.615
Did you get hurt?

29:08.615 --> 29:09.335
Did they beat you?

29:09.336 --> 29:10.214
No.

29:10.215 --> 29:11.734
Granny beat them with the toy sword,

29:11.735 --> 29:12.935
so her hand got scratched.

29:13.495 --> 29:16.735
And,
I'd return the toy sword to Hurzi tomorrow.

29:18.295 --> 29:19.614
You should've seen it.

29:19.615 --> 29:22.775
Granny was so cool when she
waved the sword in her hand.

29:23.455 --> 29:25.214
Was it cool?

29:25.215 --> 29:27.454
I felt scared.

29:27.455 --> 29:28.294
Yao is not at home.

29:28.295 --> 29:31.055
If anything bad happens to you,
he will get mad.

29:51.335 --> 29:52.335
Xu Hongdou.

29:55.615 --> 29:56.975
She is not here.

29:57.615 --> 29:59.135
She left early today.

29:59.535 --> 30:00.615
Is she not here?

30:01.055 --> 30:02.654
I heard she went to ride a horse.

30:02.655 --> 30:03.895
Horse?

30:07.615 --> 30:08.654
Granny.

30:08.655 --> 30:10.854
You should have told me
if she takes Lil Cute for a ride.

30:10.855 --> 30:12.534
You didn't ask me.

30:12.535 --> 30:13.734
Where is she going?

30:13.735 --> 30:14.735
I don't know.

30:15.575 --> 30:18.174
I didn't expect you
came back so early.

30:18.175 --> 30:19.654
You can call her.

30:19.655 --> 30:20.814
But she didn't answer.

30:20.815 --> 30:23.215
Then wait for her at home.

30:57.175 --> 30:58.175
Xu Hongdou.

31:01.135 --> 31:03.415
It's dangerous for you
to ride a house alone.

31:03.735 --> 31:04.535
What if you fall?

31:04.536 --> 31:05.775
You'll get hurt seriously.

31:06.815 --> 31:08.574
Why did you come back so early?

31:08.575 --> 31:10.815
I've been on my way
home 4 o'clock this morning

31:11.575 --> 31:12.255
You were in trouble.

31:12.256 --> 31:13.574
You should have told me.

31:13.575 --> 31:15.335
Or I would come back last night.

31:16.175 --> 31:18.375
I told Xiaochun not to tell you.

31:18.615 --> 31:20.294
So who called you?

31:20.295 --> 31:21.295
Ye Sen.

31:22.455 --> 31:23.254
I'm sorry.

31:23.255 --> 31:24.134
I brought you into this.

31:24.135 --> 31:25.254
It must be hard for you.

31:25.255 --> 31:26.455
I am sorry. I am so sorry.

31:27.975 --> 31:29.894
It was your fault yesterday.

31:29.895 --> 31:30.215
Yes.

31:30.216 --> 31:31.134
Yes. Yes.

31:31.135 --> 31:32.695
I didn't,
I didn't handle it well.

31:33.095 --> 31:34.455
I didn't mean that.

31:36.655 --> 31:38.495
Do you remember what you promised before?

31:40.015 --> 31:43.375
We shouldn't hide anything from each other.

31:44.095 --> 31:46.375
We'd share our information
and fight together.

31:46.615 --> 31:47.615
Is it right?

31:49.535 --> 31:50.695
Yes.

31:51.935 --> 31:56.454
So why didn't you tell me
someone would invest a lot

31:56.455 --> 31:59.375
and you have an all-around development plan?

32:00.095 --> 32:01.774
It's a bit complicated.

32:01.775 --> 32:03.014
I'm not sure about the investment.

32:03.015 --> 32:04.895
It will let you down, so I didn't say anything.

32:05.255 --> 32:06.814
Secretary had a meeting in the town yesterday.

32:06.815 --> 32:08.415
He went to discuss it.

32:09.335 --> 32:10.575
Let me down?

32:13.295 --> 32:15.855
What they offer is really profitable.

32:16.415 --> 32:17.894
If we develop our village,

32:17.895 --> 32:20.534
villagers can make a lot of money from the rent.

32:20.535 --> 32:22.375
There will be more work opportunities.

32:22.615 --> 32:23.974
It's good for your business.

32:23.975 --> 32:25.494
And I can earn a lot from it.

32:25.495 --> 32:28.255
For our future,
we'll have more chances.

32:28.935 --> 32:30.255
But if we do it,

32:30.615 --> 32:32.654
our village is like a
car only with a throttle,

32:32.655 --> 32:34.094
but without a break.

32:34.095 --> 32:35.414
So we will die of car crashes,

32:35.415 --> 32:38.055
or we have to wait
till we run out of energy to stop.

32:38.295 --> 32:40.814
This is different from our
local development initiative.

32:40.815 --> 32:41.654
So I want to wait and see

32:41.655 --> 32:43.574
what kind of decisions
our Village Committee make

32:43.575 --> 32:45.175
then I'll make up my mind.

32:47.175 --> 32:48.175
Xie Zhiyao.

32:49.495 --> 32:50.935
Do you really think

32:52.055 --> 32:53.375
I love your money?

32:54.055 --> 32:55.775
Of course not.

32:57.135 --> 32:59.734
So in your eyes,
I'm always on the make.

32:59.735 --> 33:01.174
I seek nothing but money.

33:01.175 --> 33:02.175
Do you think so?

33:03.775 --> 33:07.135
You think I'm looking
forward to the investment

33:07.335 --> 33:09.215
and hope you'll accept it.

33:11.215 --> 33:13.175
After all, I wasn't born here.

33:13.735 --> 33:15.375
I wouldn't feel I belong here.

33:17.735 --> 33:21.574
Then,
when the villages are out of resources,

33:21.575 --> 33:23.774
I'll find another Yunmiao Village,

33:23.775 --> 33:27.495
and keep sucking blood like a leech.

33:28.055 --> 33:29.055
Do you agree?

33:30.135 --> 33:32.415
That's not what I think.

33:34.295 --> 33:36.614
But in all,
it's all my fault. I am sorry.

33:36.615 --> 33:38.575
I hope you won't get angry at this, will you?

33:40.135 --> 33:42.135
You keep looking down at me,

33:42.495 --> 33:43.414
right?

33:43.415 --> 33:46.814
Do you think I am your girlfriend,
so you say sweet words?

33:46.815 --> 33:47.255
Right?

33:47.256 --> 33:49.454
Whatever happens, you always apologize first,

33:49.455 --> 33:50.975
and say you're sorry.

33:51.215 --> 33:52.215
Wait.

33:52.975 --> 33:54.094
What's wrong with my apology?

33:54.095 --> 33:55.375
What's wrong with being nice?

33:57.815 --> 33:59.174
Well, well, well.

33:59.175 --> 34:00.094
I am sorry.

34:00.095 --> 34:01.374
I'll stand here and take the punishment.

34:01.375 --> 34:02.855
What you said is the right thing.

34:25.935 --> 34:26.975
We should...

34:28.255 --> 34:29.575
Just leave it for a moment.

34:39.735 --> 34:40.735
Hongdou.

34:42.535 --> 34:43.335
Xu Hongdou.

34:43.336 --> 34:44.695
I don't want to talk to you.

34:59.135 --> 35:00.135
Granny.

35:00.655 --> 35:02.215
Are you going to the market?

35:09.135 --> 35:10.894
Take a break today.

35:10.895 --> 35:12.614
Could you go to help at Hongdou's place?

35:12.615 --> 35:14.734
Why don't you go there?

35:14.735 --> 35:15.854
I have to find them,

35:15.855 --> 35:17.254
and I will stop them from coming to her.

35:17.255 --> 35:19.014
How can you do it by yourself?

35:19.015 --> 35:20.254
You should report to the office.

35:20.255 --> 35:21.774
The office will solve the problem.

35:21.775 --> 35:22.534
No, I can't.

35:22.535 --> 35:23.655
I have to do it alone.

35:24.775 --> 35:26.294
You're mad now.

35:26.295 --> 35:29.295
If you find them,
you will fight with them.

35:29.855 --> 35:31.695
The odds to win are for me.

35:33.295 --> 35:34.295
Sit down.

35:39.975 --> 35:42.455
Did you quarrel with Hongdou?

35:44.295 --> 35:46.254
She said I looked down on her,

35:46.255 --> 35:48.414
I spoiled her and overprotected her.

35:48.415 --> 35:50.334
So, whatever I did is wrong.

35:50.335 --> 35:51.695
What can I do?

35:53.415 --> 35:58.055
Your strategies to take care
of me are not working for her.

35:58.495 --> 36:00.334
Wait. What do you mean by strategies?

36:00.335 --> 36:03.495
It sounds like I am pretentious
and have bad intentions.

36:05.015 --> 36:09.254
Do you think I am too
old to have a clear mind?

36:09.255 --> 36:12.335
So you have to take me as a baby.

36:13.455 --> 36:15.094
Do you think my brain is not working?

36:15.095 --> 36:16.774
So you don't have to tell the truth,

36:16.775 --> 36:18.134
making me happy is enough for me.

36:18.135 --> 36:20.254
You think what you do is good for me,

36:20.255 --> 36:22.294
so I have to do whatever you say.

36:22.295 --> 36:24.535
If I don't listen to you, I am the trouble.

36:30.495 --> 36:33.615
But to be honest,
I am not stupid.

36:34.735 --> 36:36.774
I'm listening to every word you say,

36:36.775 --> 36:38.775
because you will be happy about it.

36:39.615 --> 36:40.814
So is it all for me?

36:40.815 --> 36:41.974
Sure.

36:41.975 --> 36:43.375
You are my grandson.

36:44.215 --> 36:45.895
I don't haggle over it with you.

36:51.375 --> 36:52.375
Shall we?

36:52.615 --> 36:54.175
Take me to the stall.

36:54.455 --> 36:55.654
No. Granny.

36:55.655 --> 36:57.974
You should go to help Hongdou.

36:57.975 --> 36:59.734
Why should I do that?

36:59.735 --> 37:02.734
Our daily life is not over
even some bad things happen.

37:02.735 --> 37:03.735
Let's go.

37:06.455 --> 37:08.935
You don't take my orders, do you?

37:09.455 --> 37:10.455
President Xie.

37:11.535 --> 37:12.535
Granny.

37:13.175 --> 37:14.215
What's going on?

37:16.255 --> 37:19.894
Director asked me to
tell you to stay calm.

37:19.895 --> 37:22.134
Don't take others
there for more trouble.

37:22.135 --> 37:24.134
And he said he would solve it.

37:24.135 --> 37:24.974
No.

37:24.975 --> 37:26.374
I have to solve it on my own.

37:26.375 --> 37:27.814
Don't act like a kid.

37:27.815 --> 37:30.175
You can't solve the problem
by letting out your anger.

37:30.535 --> 37:31.654
You should think.

37:31.655 --> 37:33.974
Will Hongdou keep running her business here?

37:33.975 --> 37:36.534
She said it every day,
peace brings prosperity.

37:36.535 --> 37:38.055
Don't you have a bigger picture?

37:38.295 --> 37:41.294
He's mad now,
so he has lost his head.

37:41.295 --> 37:45.255
Listen to Huang,
you should think in Hongdou's shoes.

37:48.095 --> 37:50.334
Well, they must say sorry to Hongdou.

37:50.335 --> 37:51.534
No problem. An apology.

37:51.535 --> 37:52.734
They will do it.

37:52.735 --> 37:53.374
Great.

37:53.375 --> 37:54.615
Time to leave.

37:56.615 --> 37:57.975
Move.

38:06.735 --> 38:07.614
Let's go.

38:07.615 --> 38:08.615
Go.

38:11.895 --> 38:12.895
Be careful. Granny.

38:13.055 --> 38:14.055
Here.

38:14.575 --> 38:15.575
Lock the door. Granny.

38:27.735 --> 38:28.855
Mr. Yang.

38:36.215 --> 38:38.375
You... Why are you here?

38:40.015 --> 38:41.015
Nothing.

38:46.535 --> 38:48.455
What, what about a cup of tea?

38:49.815 --> 38:50.815
Okay.

39:42.455 --> 39:46.334
Well,
the ingredients of coffee are needed more

39:46.335 --> 39:49.095
when it is in this season.

39:49.495 --> 39:50.814
As well as the desserts.

39:50.815 --> 39:53.654
This month has a few holidays,
so we have to prepare more

39:53.655 --> 39:54.854
in advance.

39:54.855 --> 39:55.454
It's right.

39:55.455 --> 39:56.734
When I go to the supplier next time,

39:56.735 --> 39:59.054
I will buy more ingredients
for coffee and desserts.

39:59.055 --> 39:59.535
Good.

39:59.536 --> 40:00.895
And look here.

40:27.655 --> 40:28.655
Hello, kids.

40:34.335 --> 40:35.574
Are you Hulu?

40:35.575 --> 40:36.575
Am I right?

40:36.615 --> 40:37.974
Do you know me?

40:37.975 --> 40:38.975
Of course, I do.

40:39.295 --> 40:42.415
Hulu is the only
girl in the four kids.

40:43.655 --> 40:44.655
And I know you, too.

40:44.895 --> 40:45.895
You're Guobao.

40:47.735 --> 40:51.454
But I can't tell who is
Huzi and who is Tuotuo.

40:51.455 --> 40:53.254
I am not sure about it.

40:53.255 --> 40:55.695
I am Tuotuo. And he is Huzi.

40:57.055 --> 40:58.255
So your name is Tuotuo.

40:58.495 --> 40:59.775
Who are you?

41:02.975 --> 41:04.775
You must have heard of me.

41:05.055 --> 41:06.055
If I tell you,

41:06.815 --> 41:08.135
you'll get scared.

41:08.455 --> 41:10.374
Why are we scared of you?

41:10.375 --> 41:11.534
Are you doing child trafficking?

41:11.535 --> 41:14.774
We will not eat your
snacks or leave with you.

41:14.775 --> 41:16.294
We are not afraid of you.

41:16.295 --> 41:18.294
My mom and uncle are in there.

41:18.295 --> 41:20.615
If I shout out, they'll come to kick you out.

41:22.455 --> 41:23.735
Well done.

41:24.455 --> 41:26.135
That's what you should do.

41:29.415 --> 41:30.415
Xie Qiang.

41:31.855 --> 41:32.855
Get in.

41:36.295 --> 41:37.335
Have fun.

41:42.055 --> 41:42.854
Qiang.

41:42.855 --> 41:43.734
Xiaochun.

41:43.735 --> 41:45.374
Xie Qiang?

41:45.375 --> 41:47.295
He is Xie Qiang.

41:51.935 --> 41:53.815
What are you running for?

42:01.335 --> 42:01.775
Yao.

42:01.775 --> 42:02.775
Good to see you.

42:03.735 --> 42:04.534
What do you drink?

42:04.535 --> 42:05.494
Coffee or tea?

42:05.495 --> 42:06.494
I'm good with it.

42:06.495 --> 42:07.495
I'm not thirsty.

42:07.735 --> 42:09.095
Then water.

42:11.335 --> 42:12.975
I went to your horse ranch.

42:13.495 --> 42:14.695
It's terrific.

42:14.935 --> 42:16.574
Every time I invited you to my house,

42:16.575 --> 42:17.735
you didn't come at all.

42:18.575 --> 42:20.534
No,
I had to fertilize the orchard recently.

42:20.535 --> 42:21.695
I didn't have time.

42:22.775 --> 42:23.711
Take a seat.

42:23.735 --> 42:25.334
I don't have to.

42:25.335 --> 42:26.454
Make yourself at home.

42:26.455 --> 42:27.455
Just sit down.

42:29.015 --> 42:30.015
Sit.

42:32.295 --> 42:34.854
Though you're back for a few days,
you got tanned,

42:34.855 --> 42:36.775
but you look energetic.

42:38.375 --> 42:39.375
Yao.

42:39.735 --> 42:43.454
Look,
the smartphone you gave to me is so advanced

42:43.455 --> 42:45.135
that I don't know the function.

42:45.375 --> 42:46.414
It's a waste to me.

42:46.415 --> 42:47.815
Take your time to learn it.

42:48.055 --> 42:51.335
You have to learn and
adapt to new and good things.

42:59.215 --> 43:00.215
What's the problem?

43:02.615 --> 43:04.614
Don't be shy with me.

43:04.615 --> 43:05.735
Just tell me.

43:12.615 --> 43:13.615
Yao.

43:14.975 --> 43:16.055
My...

43:16.455 --> 43:18.455
My parents are getting old now,

43:19.175 --> 43:20.815
I don't want to work away from home.

43:22.815 --> 43:25.535
When I was in prison,
I figured it out

43:26.215 --> 43:28.614
that how much money I
make doesn't matter at all,

43:28.615 --> 43:30.255
as much as it is enough for a family.

43:31.215 --> 43:32.414
So...

43:32.415 --> 43:33.815
I want to ask you for a favor.

43:34.295 --> 43:36.455
If you need any labor worker,

43:36.735 --> 43:37.975
can you tell me?

43:40.215 --> 43:42.335
I can carry bricks and
load up or unload packages.

43:44.055 --> 43:45.295
Not only in the orchard,

43:45.615 --> 43:47.095
I want to do some part-time jobs.

43:49.775 --> 43:50.775
No problem.

43:52.895 --> 43:55.295
It's not bad... to work in the village.

43:55.855 --> 43:58.375
But, a village is small,

43:58.655 --> 43:59.894
and people are too bored,

43:59.895 --> 44:02.135
so some of them like gossiping about others.

44:02.735 --> 44:03.974
They don't have bad intentions.

44:03.975 --> 44:05.214
Just to kill time.

44:05.215 --> 44:06.614
Don't mind if you hear some.

44:06.615 --> 44:08.215
It'll be over if they find no fun in it.

44:09.335 --> 44:10.775
I'm fine.

44:11.375 --> 44:12.375
It's just...

44:12.975 --> 44:14.655
my mom will worry about it.

44:15.895 --> 44:17.534
Don't worry about Auntie.

44:17.535 --> 44:18.894
She's been through a lot.

44:18.895 --> 44:20.495
So it doesn't bother her at all.

44:21.495 --> 44:22.495
Yes, she is.

44:24.415 --> 44:25.415
By the way,

44:25.575 --> 44:27.934
how is your girlfriend?

44:27.935 --> 44:30.135
I heard from mom when
I came home last night.

44:30.735 --> 44:31.975
She's good.

44:32.295 --> 44:34.855
It was because of
misunderstandings and gossips.

44:36.895 --> 44:37.895
SYao.

44:38.215 --> 44:39.695
You have to face a lot every day,

44:40.055 --> 44:41.255
it's hard to go through it.

44:43.575 --> 44:44.935
Nothing is easy.

44:45.535 --> 44:47.014
It's hard to keep a career.

44:47.015 --> 44:48.575
It's hard to maintain a relationship.

44:49.135 --> 44:50.175
Nothing is easy.

44:53.775 --> 44:59.295
♫ Listen to the rain
falling into the silent forest ♫

45:01.215 --> 45:06.215
♫ Enjoy the mountainous landscape at sunset ♫

